50
00:06:14,572 --> 00:06:17,370
Here is the twin update loop.

51
00:06:17,370 --> 00:06:21,099
First, the application loads the patient's historical profile.

52
00:06:21,099 --> 00:06:32,290
Second, it reads recent timestamped observations and derives a
current glucose estimate, a recent trend, time since the last meal,

53
00:06:32,290 --> 00:06:35,554
