57
00:06:50,941 --> 00:06:59,334
The five-minute advance action changes the in-memory observation
state, after which the current profile and forecast are refreshed.

58
00:06:59,334 --> 00:07:08,659
If the backend restarts, that simulated stream returns to the seed
data because it is not persisted in a database.

59
